    "zh-CN": "面向 Coding 用户的 DSH 整合包。v3.1.0-pre.1 基于 DSH 0.2.2-rc.1，挂载 10 个通过宿主兼容门禁的插件；dsh-workbuddy-connect 因仍精确锁定旧基座而移除。本预发布包不再随包安装跨 harness skill。",
    "en-US": "A coding-oriented DSH modpack. v3.1.0-pre.1 is based on DSH 0.2.2-rc.1 and mounts 10 plugins that pass the host compatibility gate. dsh-workbuddy-connect is removed because it still pins the old host exactly. This pre-release no longer ships cross-harness skills."
